// The driver's .5m/s motor change ramps in over four substeps. Each share
// reaches the touching passive body through a rigid contact (inside the
// slop), so both carry -.25m/s after tick 0; only the passive body then takes
// .9 drag. Tick 1 repeats from -.25 and -.225: -.475 and -.4275.
// Touching is not crowding.
